{
  "_about": [
    "DSG + Silvis personal totals card (Faraz 10/9; decisions 2026-10-11). SYNTHETIC data, hand-tallied.",
    "Input of callTotalsFor({ weeks, roster, silvisRows, code, today }) in helpers.js; `expected` is its exact output.",
    "The Silvis app (Prompt 31) copies this file and must produce the same `expected` from the same input.",
    "DSG rule = Stats -> Billing (weekBillingCredits): a service week = 1 day per date Mon-Sun (an override moves its date),",
    "a weeknight = its date, the weekend = Fri + Sat + Sun, a covered holiday (type not 'swap') = 2 days to the coverer on",
    "its date and that date's regular credits drop. A backup week counts the same way, as backup roles (dcB/nightsB/wkndB/holB).",
    "Silvis: primary_code = code -> silvisP, backup_code = code -> silvisB; one 07:00-07:00 day = 1.",
    "dsg = dc+nights+wknd+hol; dsgB = dcB+nightsB+wkndB+holB; total = dsg+dsgB+silvisP+silvisB;",
    "weighted = dsg + silvisP + 0.5 x (dsgB + silvisB). A day on or before `today` is worked; after it, scheduled.",
    "Periods: month = today's calendar month; ytd = Jan 1 .. today; year = Jan 1 .. Dec 31; rolling12 = the day after",
    "(today minus 12 months, Feb 29 -> Feb 28) .. today; months = Jan .. Dec of today's year.",
    "PARITY: in the app, `today` is the DEVICE date fmt(new Date()) in BOTH apps (decision 2026-10-11), never a Central-time date.",
    "PORT (Silvis Prompt 31): weekBillingCredits + callTotalPeriods + callTotalsFor verbatim, NIGHT_KEYS = [mon,tue,wed,thu], in a new module",
    "after Silvis's helpers.js (reuse its identical fmt/parse/addD); see the PARITY CONTRACT comment in this app's helpers.js."
  ],
